    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brainrot: Animal Quizzes is not just a game, but a true immersion into a mysterious world where the mythology of Italy comes to life in the bizarre forms of chimeras! Uncover the secrets of ancient creatures, whose images are crafted from legends, historical riddles, and fantastical interpretations. A vast universe awaits \u2014 where every quiz becomes a key to unraveling centuries-old mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688420/extras/41985956334760f6d1006f1de842e6ec.avif?t=1747066930\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of thrilling modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race Against Time \u2014 Challenge friends in adrenaline-fueled duels where every second counts, and mistakes lead to costly missteps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expert Challenge \u2014 Test your knowledge by identifying chimeras through intricate patterns on their hides, the curve of their claws, and the glint in their eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linguistic Analysis \u2014 Decipher the ancients\u2019 cryptic language: dissect the names of creatures to decode their essence and weaknesses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes the game unique?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Bestiary \u2014 Collect creatures to populate it with vivid descriptions and illustrations. The more you discover, the richer its lore becomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements with Character \u2014 Earn titles  by identifying all chimeras of a type or dominating competitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community &amp; Mythcrafting \u2014 Shape the evolving lore of chimeras! Design your own fantastical creatures, and you might even encounter them in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688420/extras/441050e823c30f4be4d9563a580261f9.poster.avif?t=1747066930\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688420/extras/441050e823c30f4be4d9563a580261f9.webm?t=1747066930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688420/extras/441050e823c30f4be4d9563a580261f9.mp4?t=1747066930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face creatures that defy existence? Download Brainrot: Animal Quizzes \u2014 where your mind becomes the boundary between humanity\u2019s realm and the domain of chimeras!</p>",
